.TH PLAY_140P 1 "August 2026" "v1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
play_140p \- Minimalist YouTube Player with Digital Wellbeing & Speech Recognition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B play_140p
[\fIURL_OR_QUERY\fR] [\fISPEED\fR] [\fIMODE\fR]
.br
.B play_140p status
.br
.B play_140p convert
\fIFILE_OR_URL\fR...
.br
.B play_140p transcribe
\fIFILE_OR_URL\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B play_140p
is a terminal YouTube player and audio utility designed for low bandwidth and digital wellbeing.
It includes auto-cutoff locks (60 min daily limit), clipboard detection, terminal ASCII thumbnail previews, automatic missing dependency detection and auto-installation (via system package manager dnf, apt, pacman, zypper, or pip for tools such as mpv, yt-dlp, ffmpeg, fzf, chafa, or SpeechRecognition), unlimited batch parallel audio conversion, and speech-to-text transcription.

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Display current daily watch usage and cooldown lock status.
.TP
.B convert \fIFILE_OR_URL\fR...
Delegate unlimited parallel audio conversion to \fBaudioconvert\fR.
.TP
.B transcribe \fIFILE_OR_URL\fR
Transcribe audio track from local file or web URL to text.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B play_140p "lofi beats"
Search YouTube interactively with terminal thumbnail UI.
.TP
.B play_140p "https://youtu.be/..." 1.5x audio
Play YouTube video in audio-only mode at 1.5x speed.
.TP
.B play_140p status
Show usage statistics and lockdown status.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR audioconvert (1),
.BR mpv (1),
.BR fzf (1)
